# DianaSh golden corpus. Recorded from the C# shell, byte for byte; EMUSEN_DIANASH_GOLDEN=record rewrites it - see EmuSen_DianaSh.md §13.4.
# Patterns: <ROOT> is the sandbox's real root, <TEMP> the corpus's real temporary folder, <INSTALL> the install's real directory;
# a 'match' block is a regular expression the whole output must match, written where a line prints a time or a measured number.
command snapshot
usage 1   snapshot <space> <name>       capture <space>'s full current contents under <name>
usage 2   snapshot list                 list saved snapshots (name, space, size)
usage 3   snapshot remove <name>        delete a saved snapshot

case snapshots of the fake target
target fake
covers 1-3
$ snapshot
out 71
Usage: snapshot <space> <name> | snapshot list | snapshot remove <name>
status 0
action none
$ snapshot list
out 19
No saved snapshots.
status 0
action none
$ snapshot RAM
out 30
Usage: snapshot <space> <name>
status 0
action none
$ snapshot RAM before
out 40
Snapshot 'before' saved: RAM, 256 bytes.
status 0
action none
$ snapshot IO io
out 147
IO can have real side effects on read (live hardware registers) - refusing a bulk snapshot there. Try WRAM (or another plain-memory space) instead.
status 0
action none
$ snapshot NOPE x
out 83
Error: No memory space named 'NOPE'. Available: RAM, ROM, VRAM, IO, UNSIZED, CpuBus
status 1
action none
$ snapshot ROM rom
out 37
Snapshot 'rom' saved: ROM, 512 bytes.
status 0
action none
$ snapshot list
out 48
  before: RAM (256 bytes)
  rom: ROM (512 bytes)
status 0
action none
$ snapshot remove
out 29
Usage: snapshot remove <name>
status 0
action none
$ snapshot remove rom
out 23
Snapshot 'rom' removed.
status 0
action none
$ snapshot remove rom
out 24
No snapshot named 'rom'.
status 0
action none
$ snapshot RAM before
out 40
Snapshot 'before' saved: RAM, 256 bytes.
status 0
action none
$ snapshot list
out 25
  before: RAM (256 bytes)
status 0
action none
end

case with no target
target none
covers 1
$ snapshot RAM x
out 65
Error: No ROM loaded - this command needs an active debug target.
status 1
action none
$ snapshot list
out 19
No saved snapshots.
status 0
action none
end
